[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_ARTIFACT_STAR_SWIRLS_TIME_TRAVEL_SPELL]
Star Swirls Time Travel Spell

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_ARTIFACT_STAR_SWIRLS_TIME_TRAVEL_SPELL_DESC]
A time travel spell that was almost torn apart. At the last moment, the one who tried to destroy the spell was stopped by a key figure who cannot be named today, and then the spell fell into a time portal and disappeared into random times.
Now, it has reappeared in this world. Will it have the opportunity to open a new timeline change? Wait... how can we judge whether the timeline of this world has already been changed? Is this spell really the same one that disappeared in the first place?
More importantly... is the effect of this spell really time travel?

